rmat=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lightbringer_s_Basin_5feea3.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a lightbringer's basin.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">As long as it burns, no hellish creatures can break through the thin layer between our worlds.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Formorgar%20Glacier\">Formorgar Glacier</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Plains%20of%20Havoc\">Plains of Havoc</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Forbidden%20Lands\">Forbidden Lands</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwacatra\">Dwacatra</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ramoa\">Ramoa</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Hero%20Cave\">Hero Cave</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Drefia\">Drefia</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Hellgate\">Hellgate</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Tarpit%20Tomb\">Tarpit Tomb</a>, Magician Quarter/Restricted Area during the <a href=\"#/quest/the-lightbearer\">The Lightbearer</a> event.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>The flame will extinguish after 3 hours, but luckily this can be prevented by using a <a href=\"#/wiki/Magical%20Torch\">Magical Torch</a> on it to reset its expiration time.<br/>It looks similar to a <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Basin\">Fire Basin</a> but with sparkles.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Acolyte%20of%20Darkness\">Acolyte of Darkness</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bane%20of%20Light\">Bane of Light</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bride%20of%20Night\">Bride of Night</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Doomsday%20Cultist\">Doomsday Cultist</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Duskbringer\">Duskbringer</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Basin\">Fire Basin</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Herald%20of%20Gloom\">Herald of Gloom</a></li><li>Illumination</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Keeper%20of%20the%20Flame\">Keeper of the Flame</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Magical%20Torch\">Magical Torch</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Midnight%20Spawn\">Midnight Spawn</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Midnight%20Warrior\">Midnight Warrior</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Nightslayer\">Nightslayer</a></li><li>Other Objects</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Shadow%20Hound\">Shadow Hound</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-lightbearer\">The Lightbearer</a></li><li>Utilities</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["the-lightbearer"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"the-lightbearer","quest":"The Lightbearer","step":"0-4","n":5,"title":"Como funciona a tocha","kind":"mention","coords":[]}]}}